    "P114 retains 61 rejected generations; useful generation and compliant model abstention remain unproven.",
    "Native BM25 capture has 20 searches and 80 cutoff evaluations; it is not a generator comparison. Positive grades never mix within a native query; mixed-grade demonstrations use separately authored controls.",
